<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina says placed $6.1 bln reverse repos.</title>
<headline>Argentina says placed $6.1 bln reverse repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Tuesday it placed $6.1 billion in overnight reverse repurchase agreements April 19.</p>
<p>The reverse repos were set against government bonds at 5.0 percent.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
